      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that uses a concrete external provider for email and password login. I will use the Firebase Authentication service, which is a well-known provider for user authentication. The code will import the Firebase Admin SDK, initialize the app, and use the SDK to authenticate users with email and password, returning the tokens. </thinking>\n",
