      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create a Python script that registers a new user with an external provider, I need to choose a concrete external service. For this task, I will use Firebase Authentication, which is a widely used service for handling user authentication. The script will use the Firebase Admin SDK to create a new user account. </thinking>\n",
